<description>&lt;p&gt;China is threatening to cut undersea cables linking Taiwan and the Philippines while increasing patrols near Taiwan, and a Chinese vessel carrying unidentified equipment was probed by the Philippine Coast Guard inside Scarborough Shoal. The Philippine Coast Guard rescued a ferry in Quezon waters, delivered fuel to fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, and assisted over 150,000 sea travelers during the Undas period. Philippine officials criticised China’s inconsistent stance on UNCLOS and the South China Sea. The conflict remains low-intensity, with 176 battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVTQzT3kxVmMtak9FMGI2bmhlVnFuUkpqUnZtWVE1SFRnaG93UVlOU3ZWQklTRDlqcTFJYTZOQXB1UnkxRHVOSDctN1ZJLTFxVElQeGtFaTRGcXJMZTQ1RGVIM2lXWWNxa3EzWTRNWS1FRWhjZ25BNUY3WnVmeFE3TEFLbi1OZzNQVEhOUFVPaDZ6ZlVaYV81NGVpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOeHBuZXRKMVZlSi1ldXVtVWp0ekI4Yi13Wk9xMjBOSC02OURfTExUSXJEbXFCOFU1emQ3UExjQ1FLLUdtUnM2YjVKc0RMQTFRTWxMbV9qR09zN1BIdmh0NElvVnBKaGl2NEFZRmNsc1M3OF9ueXdoejNQMXZud2NOSG9fTnN3c0psMmNCRkFDaXhRenF5ZmVHRi0xS2toWThRS0R5WC1LZjNzbkNiZEVLWHhCVk11X0dtM29wZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOLW9PLVpRWTJtWmI4RTZfTktma1NnaG5HUnpCVXhpZzN6ZVdBOUc1cmdDZEl4VWlUbFQ0U2JvdC0zMjBoOXVFUDNzbGNvZlQ2WEhLNUFjZ1JXUkExeHF5Yko2VnhaclVrcHZsRlF3WVJiZWstdkhBbkpRZlRkemxJZGt3eU5nLVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;rpnradio.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQQU0yM0VyVlhQLW9lSDc4bERCWHBjZFp2eEJoSTFRdFVJc19yTzFac0s2ZWZoYVdlNVNrU1pIVHN0OXpRNGNScVZhVFhVMDhzcjVrRDBZbkV0RDgyMUpnZ3RSVHc2T2VGdUtmZHNWSjBleUJyUzZ3QmZlMy1ncUVEbWJhMzVMZmQ4SjVCYmV0MTdCd2lXYWFmUHlDMVJETjRwQWZmZ2RZWmRE